{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE'S SOMETHING WRONG WITH THIS SCHOOL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.poster.avif?t=1767644214\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.webm?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.mp4?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been taken to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Fret, a sentient guitar trapped inside. Hide. Distract. Dodge. Outsmart what hunts you, and survive long enough to uncover the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL IS ABOUT CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.poster.avif?t=1767644214\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.webm?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.mp4?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to noise, including yours</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break line of sight to stay hidden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use objects and sound as decoys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and evade when cornered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun enemies with your evolving guitar tuner</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MUSIC IS BUILT INTO EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.poster.avif?t=1767644214\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.webm?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.mp4?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is how the world works.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve piano, guitar, harp and other musical puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths using memory devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete puzzles while nearby threats force you to act fast</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT MAKES DON\u2019T FRET DIFFERENT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/a1955ad2552a57644f6a07240728b68f.poster.avif?t=1767644214\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/a1955ad2552a57644f6a07240728b68f.webm?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/a1955ad2552a57644f6a07240728b68f.mp4?t=1767644214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth comes first. Dodge enemies, stay out of sight, and don't get caught by them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guitar tuner is your main tool. Use it to read danger, solve puzzles, stun enemies, and adapt as the game progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy plays differently. Learning how they behave is how you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musical puzzles block your path and have to be solved to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories unlock new paths and help you understand why you\u2019re here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716830?t=1767644214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716830?t=1767644214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/fc3a4d1e6a16e514257cd0e379e1c56d61d35565/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767644214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/fc3a4d1e6a16e514257cd0e379e1c56d61d35565/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767644214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3202450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE'S SOMETHING WRONG WITH THIS SCHOOL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.poster.avif?t=1767644214\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic